      "writtenOn": "2022-08-19T14:09:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just throwing this out there for discussion, since this is called from a metal specific class (MtlPietRenderer), would we want to just reverse the logic and add a function on MtlCommandBuffer that was something like, MtlCommandBuffer::renderPietScene(const skgpu::piet::Scene\u0026 scene, const Texture* target)?",
