      "message": "Well it can\u0027t just only be a top level CB function. We have to get into backend specific code because piet is setup specifically to take Mtl* objects in its calls. Now if we could get piet to make a more backend agnostic API using things similar to our Backend* classes, then more of this code could just live in the top, non-backend specific classes in Skia.",
